    Header 2|Jodit Editor
    Text This page demonstrates the Jodit WYSIWYG HTML editor loadable control.
    Text Use the toolbar to format the document. Use the Source button to edit its HTML.
    gap
    Jodit.Editor:HTMLEditor
      Width: 100%
      Height: 400
      HTML:
        <h3>Hello, World!</h3>
        <p>Edit this text as you would in a word processor.</p>
